ashad", "title": "U See Dem Hoez 09' (feat. DJ Gant-Man)", "conf": "low", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=DJ+Rashad+U+See+Dem+Hoez+09%27+%28feat.+DJ+Gant-Man%29", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=DJ+Rashad+U+See+Dem+Hoez+09%27+%28feat.+DJ+Gant-Man%29", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=DJ+Rashad+U+See+Dem+Hoez+09%27+%28feat.+DJ+Gant-Man%29", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/DJ+Rashad+U+See+Dem+Hoez+09%27+%28feat.+DJ+Gant-Man%29", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/298168813", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/DJ+Rashad+U+See+Dem+Hoez+09%27+%28feat.+DJ+Gant-Man%29", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=DJ+Rashad+U+See+Dem+Hoez+09%27+%28feat.+DJ+Gant-Man%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2008 Juke Trax Online"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 4, "low": 17}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:02:49", "end": "00:04:47", "text": "Hello and a happy Sunday afternoon to you. It's time for Loose Joints. My name's Ian McCarthy aka Red Shoes. I'm filling in for the next couple of hours. Very, very excited to be mixing for you. shouts out to my gente crew for the incredible uh mix playing just before shaking my booty coming into the studio before we go any further i want to take a moment to acknowledge that we are broadcasting to you today from unceded gadical land here in red fern i'd like to pay my respects to gadical elders past present and emerging and recognize the ongoing colonial violence committed across this country just a reminder as well that regardless of where you're listening in around so-called sydney or indeed so-called australia you are on stolen land it always was and always will be aboriginal land to take a moment as well to recognize the queer and poc cultures that really built the dance music scenes i feel like uh people especially kind of in places like sydney can sometimes forget, you know, where this music comes from and why it exists. And so I feel very privileged to be able to, you know, partake in the culture, but it's important to recognize. All right, let's get on with it. I am excited to mix for you this afternoon. Gonna start, you know, just kind of light and groovy, bit of dub, bit of breaks. And And then in the second hour, we might get a little bit faster, get into some footwork. That kind of thing. Bear with me. It's going to take me 5-10 seconds to get the decks going. And then we're going to be mixing, baby. You're locked into loose joints on FBI 94.5. Stick around."}, {"start": "00:33:18", "end": "00:33:47", "text": "You're on Loose Joints, FBi 94.5, I'm DJ Red Shoes, filling in for the afternoon, feeling groovy. Gonna start bringing that BPM just a little bit, get those asses shaking."}, {"start": "00:36:20", "end": "00:36:44", "text": "Boy, tell me if you like it. 0435123945 is the number. Let me know what you're up to on your Sunday afternoon. Let me know if the tunes are hitting. Let me know what you're looking forward to in your week. Hit me up 0435123945. You're locked into Loose Joints. I'm Red Shoes."}, {"start": "01:25:27", "end": "01:26:00", "text": ""}, {"start": "01:28:28", "end": "01:29:00", "text": "You're locked in the Loose Joints on FBi 94.5. My name is Ian McCarthy, a.k.a. DJ Red Jews. We've got about a half hour left together. If you haven't noticed, we've bumped that BPM up a little bit. Going to get a little bit crazier for the last half hour here. Going to break into some jukes and full work. Hope you enjoy. Feel free to hit me up on the text line at 435123945 is the number. Loose Joints on FBi."}, {"start": "01:40:42", "end": "01:41:16", "text": "You're locked in the Loose Joints on FBi 94.5. Red Shoes here. Probably the last time I'll speak to you for the afternoon. I hope you're enjoying the mix. Hope you're shaking some ass. Stick around. It's sold out. Stephen Farris is coming up in a little over 15 minutes. And in the meantime, I intend to keep getting freaky with you. Thanks for hanging out with me for the last couple of hours. You're on FBi. This is Loose Joints. I'm Red Shoes. Have a lovely Sunday night."}, {"start": "01:55:56", "end": "01:56:18", "text": ""}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Lose Yourself to Dance", "artists": [{"name": "Victor Lou"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:02:00"}, "track": {"title": "Funky Boogie", "artists": [{"name": "John Ozila"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:09:22"}, "track": {"title": "Say What! (London Underground Mix)", "artists": [{"name": "X-Press 2"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:10:00"}, "track": {"title": "Megamix (Long Version, pt. 1)", "artists": [{"name": "Whigfield"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:13:00"}, "track": {"title": "Horror Run", "artists": [{"name": "Myorseyl"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:14:00"}, "track": {"title": "Cage (Ad Brown Dub Mix)", "artists": [{"name": "Andre Volodin & Karina Smirnova"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:31:17"}, "track": {"title": "The Life of a Touring DJ", "artists": [{"name": "Bambounou"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:37:00"}, "track": {"title": "Tell Me If You Like It", "artists": [{"name": "bastienGOAT"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:39:44"}, "track": {"title": "L